- [MCP Setup](https://docs.context.dev/install-mcp): Connect Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, VS Code, and other MCP clients to https://mcp.context.dev/mcp with OAuth.
- [ChatGPT Plugin](https://www.context.dev/chatgpt): Install Context.dev in ChatGPT to search, scrape, extract, and research live web data from a conversation. Connects with browser OAuth, so no API key is pasted into ChatGPT.
