- [Make Integration](https://docs.context.dev/nocode/make): No-code workflow automation.

## Use Cases

- [Crawl the Web](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/web-crawling): Crawl any website into clean Markdown, one credit per page.
- [Monitor Everything](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/web-monitoring): Watch competitor pages, prices, subreddits, and regulations for changes.
- [Feed RAG Pipelines](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/rag-pipeline): Fresh web data for RAG, kept current with monitors.
- [Ground AI Agents](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/ai-grounding): Web search and fetch tools that return clean content with sources.
- [Research Agents](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/research-agents): Cited, structured answers from the live web.
- [Automated Brand Kits](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/automated-brand-kits): Generate a brand kit on demand from a single domain.
- [Automatic Personalization](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/personalization): Turn a work email into a company's logo, colors, and fonts.
- [Enrich Company Profiles](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/enrich-company-profiles): CRM and profile enrichment.
- [Enrich Transaction Data](https://www.context.dev/use-cases/enrich-transaction-data): Clean up transaction descriptors with real brand data.

## Comparisons

- [All comparisons](https://www.context.dev/compare): Context.dev compared with other scraping, crawling, search, proxy, and brand data APIs.
- [vs. Firecrawl](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-firecrawl-alternative): The same 100,000 credits for $90 instead of $99, with 100 concurrent requests instead of 25, and no charge for blocked pages.
- [vs. ScraperAPI](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-scraperapi-alternative): No credit multipliers for JavaScript rendering or protected domains.
- [vs. ScrapingBee](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-scrapingbee-alternative): One credit per page instead of stacked rendering, premium proxy, and stealth credits.
- [vs. ZenRows](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-zenrows-alternative): One credit for a rendered page on premium proxies instead of 25.
- [vs. Scrapfly](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-scrapfly-alternative): One credit for a rendered, protected page instead of 30 or more.
- [vs. Scrape.do](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-scrape-do-alternative): One credit per page instead of 25 for rendering on residential proxies, and no per-domain surcharges.
- [vs. Scrapingdog](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-scrapingdog-alternative): One credit for a rendered page on premium proxies instead of 25.
- [vs. Zyte](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-zyte-alternative): One price on every site instead of per-site difficulty tiers.
- [vs. Bright Data](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-bright-data-alternative): One credit balance and one price per page instead of per-request, per-GB, and per-record products.
- [vs. Oxylabs](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-oxylabs-alternative): JavaScript rendering in the base price for any site.
- [vs. Decodo](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-decodo-alternative): One rate per rendered page instead of four rates per request.
- [vs. Nimble](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-nimble-alternative): Self-serve plans with crawl, batches, monitors, and JSON extraction.
- [vs. Diffbot](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-diffbot-alternative): Proxies included in every page and paid plans from $20.
- [vs. Apify](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-apify-alternative): One price per page instead of compute units plus proxy traffic.
- [vs. Spider](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-spider-alternative): Crawl, batch, and monitor from one API.
- [vs. Crawl4AI](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-crawl4ai-alternative): A hosted API instead of a self-run crawler.
- [vs. Browse AI](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-browse-ai-alternative): Any URL through one API instead of recorded robots.
- [vs. Jina AI](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-jina-alternative): One price per page instead of per-token billing.
- [vs. Tavily](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-tavily-alternative): Search with page passages plus anti-bot scraping, crawling, and batches.
- [vs. Exa](https://www.context.dev/compare/the-top-exa-alternative): Search plus full-page scraping of protected sites.

