- **Search People, `POST /v1/people/search`:** find people by role, employer, location, skills, and experience, with up to 10 results per page. Each nonempty page costs 10 credits; empty results are free. [Overview](https://www.context.dev/people-search-api). [Documentation](https://docs.context.dev/api-reference/people/search).
